[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0020","text":"朝日，原来你在这里啊\n回来的时候你不在休息室，我还担心了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0030","text":"原来是在看天空啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0040","text":"今天的天空真好看啊\n让我想起上次的拍摄了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0050","text":"会是什么感觉呢──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0060","text":"如果能自由地在天上飞的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0070","text":"……对啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0080","text":"没有上下之分，不被任何东西束缚──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0090","text":"哦，飞机────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0100","text":"（──诶？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0110","text":"朝日────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0120","text":"怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0130","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0140","text":"天空，如果真的能飞的话感觉会很有趣呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0150","text":"……哈哈，是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0160","text":"怎么了？制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0170","text":"啊，没什么────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31700800_03_0180","text":"只是觉得，你好像真的飞走了一样"}]
